wgestures (2.1.2ubuntu6) noble; urgency=high

  * Replay non-gesture right clicks after the physical ButtonRelease callback
    returns, using an independent XTEST connection and a real press duration.
  * Explicitly release active and passive pointer grabs before replay so native
    context menus work in desktop icons, file managers and Chromium applications.

